# RFC 3501 / RFC 9051 EXAMINE: the mailbox is read-only and no changes to
# its permanent state are permitted. Fetching BODY[] doesn't set \Seen, and
# CLOSE doesn't expunge anything.

1 ok store 2 flags (\deleted)
1 ok fetch 1:2 uid
* 1 fetch (uid $uid1)
* 2 fetch (uid $uid2)

2 examine $mailbox
* 2 exists
2 ok [read-only]
2 ok fetch 1 body[text]
! 1 fetch (flags (\seen))
2 ok fetch 1 flags
! 1 fetch (flags (\seen))
2 ok close

1 ok noop
! $1 expunge
! $2 expunge
1 ok fetch 1:2 (uid flags)
* 1 fetch (uid $uid1 flags ())
* 2 fetch (uid $uid2 flags (\deleted))
